  "effect_entries": [
    {
      "effect": "Inutilisé.  Il apparaît comme le Méga-Bracelet du joueur garçon dans les concours Pokémon, mais il ne peut pas être obtenu.",
      "short_effect": "Gemme Sésame non utilisée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Unused.  This appears as the boy player’s Mega Bracelet in Pokémon Contests, but it cannot actually be obtained.",
      "short_effect": "Unused Key Stone.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　もったまま　たたかう\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\nみちのパワーを　ひめた　ブレスレット。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "메가스톤을 지닌 채로 싸우는\n포켓몬을 메가진화시키는\n미지의 힘을 가진 팔찌.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "隱藏著未知力量的護腕。\n能讓攜帶著超級石戰鬥的\n寶可夢進行超級進化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un bracelet aux pouvoirs mystérieux permettant\nà un Pokémon de méga-évoluer au combat s’il tient\nla bonne Méga-Gemme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Armband mit geheimnisvollen Kräften.\nEs ermöglicht Pokémon, die einen Mega-Stein\ntragen, eine Mega-Entwicklung durchzuführen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Brazalete con un poder misterioso que permite\nmegaevolucionar a Pokémon que lleven la\nMegapiedra adecuada.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Polsiera dotata di un misterioso potere.\nPermette a un Pokémon che ha una Megapietra\ndi megaevolversi durante la lotta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This bracelet contains an untold power that\nsomehow enables Pokémon carrying a Mega Stone\nto Mega Evolve in battle.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　持ったまま　戦う\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\n未知のパワーを　秘めた　ブレスレット。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
